          "iast": "vargākṣarāṇi varge'varge'vargākṣarāṇi kāt ṅbhau yaḥ |\nkhadvinavake svarā nava varge'varge navāntyavarge vā ||",
          "translation": "Āryabhaṭīya (Gītikāpāda 2): The revolutionary decimal phonetic numeral system encoding astronomical parameters into poetic metrical verses.",
