          "id": "c4_s5",
          "slideIndex": 12,
          "title": "Sanskrit in Architecture, Music & Practical Sciences",
          "m4a": "assets/audio/chap4/chapter4s5.m4a",
          "mp3": "assets/audio/chap4/chapter4s5.mp3",
          "sanskrit": "गीतं वाद्यं च नृत्यं च त्रयं सङ्गीतमुच्यते ।\nसर्वशास्त्रप्रवीणत्वं संस्कृतज्ञानेन लभ्यते ॥",
          "iast": "gītaṁ vādyaṁ ca nṛtyaṁ ca trayaṁ saṅgītamucyate |\nsarvaśāstrapravīṇatvaṁ saṁskṛtajñānena labhyate ||",
          "translation": "Vocal melody, instrumental music, and dance together constitute Saṅgīta. Comprehensive mastery over all practical sciences and fine arts is illuminated by the Sanskrit scientific lexicon.",
