          "iast": "ruśadvatsā ruśatī śvetyāgādāraigu kṛṣṇā sadanānyasyāḥ |\nsamānabandhū amṛte anūcī dyāvā varṇaṁ carata āmināne ||",
          "translation": "Ṛgveda 1.113.2: 'Radiant with her white steed, the shining Dawn arrives; the dark Night departs from her stations. Sisters of common origin, immortal, they follow one another in harmonious succession.'"
