          "sanskrit": "अशब्दमस्पर्शमरूपमव्ययं तथाऽरसं नित्यमगन्धवच्च यत् ।\nअनाद्यनन्तं महतः परं ध्रुवं निचाय्य तन्मृत्युमुखात् प्रमुच्यते ॥",
          "iast": "aśabdamasparśamarūpamavyayaṁ tathā'rasaṁ nityamagandhavacca yat |\nanādyanantaṁ mahataḥ paraṁ dhruvaṁ nicāyya tanmṛtyumukhāt pramucyate ||",
          "translation": "Kaṭha Upaniṣad 1.3.15: 'Soundless, touchless, formless, imperishable, tasteless, eternal, odourless, beginningless, endless, higher than the Great—realizing that immutable Reality, one is liberated from the jaws of Death!'"
